# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (a supplier's computed answer is an input of the next tick, which is owed; a forwarded element's answer from the World is heard in its tick) and ch. 9's forwarding (re-emission at host/[p]/0).
test a_computed_answer_is_a_tick_late

